":"シャラメ","textMapHash":385171434,"text":"や！誰にも言わないでね、ああ…何でこんなことを言ったんだろう…","nextNodeIds":[240160113]},{"nodeId":240160113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4244064170,"text":"言わないよ、大丈夫。","nextNodeIds":[240160114]},{"nodeId":240160114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4284430202,"text":"良いことみたいだな。多くの仕事をがんばってこなしている人なら、報酬を多くもらっても問題ないだろ。","nextNodeIds":[240160115]},{"nodeId":240160115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4052443634,"text":"でもどうしてそんな回りくどいことするんだ？みんなに報酬をあげたらいいんじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[240160116,240160117]},{"nodeId":240160116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":103863002,"text":"科学院では普通のことだよ。","nextNodeIds":[240160118]},{"nodeId":240160118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5256,"speakerName":"シャラメ","textMapHash":4247479074,"text":"ああ、ショワズールさんとレモンドさんが何を考えているのかわからない…","nextNodeIds":[240160119]},{"nodeId":240160119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5256,"speakerName":"シャラメ","textMapHash":167343498,"text":"でもとにかく、私は仕事を続けなきゃ。まだやることがたくさんあるの。","nextNodeIds":[240160120]},{"nodeId":240160120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5256,"speakerName":"シャラメ","textMapHash":3634508890,"text":"名誉上級研究員。手伝ってくれない？","nextNodeIds":[240160121,240160122]},{"nodeId":240160121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1648901266,"text":"もちろん。","nextNodeIds":[240160124]},{"nodeId":240160124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5256,"speakerName":"シャラメ","textMapHash":3501606578,"text":"じゃあ、周りの汚れをきれいにして。","nextNodeIds":[240160125]},{"nodeId":240160125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5256,"speakerName":"シャラメ","textMapHash":2259764322,"text":"整理の時はなるべく<color=#00E1FFFF>周りの書籍やそれらの書類</color>に触らないでね。そっちも汚れてしまったらまずいことになる。","nextNodeIds":[240160126]},{"nodeId":240160126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5256,"speakerName":"シャラメ","textMapHash":3259268242,"text